OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome rain in
OL,6,Fthe east during the evening but dry in
OL,7,Fthe west. The rain will clear east
OL,8,Fduring the evening then dry with clear
OL,9,Fspells and a touch of frost inland.
OL,10,FRain and strengthening winds in far
OL,11,Fwest later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FMainly dry at first.
OL,14,FOutbreaks of rain, heavy at times,
OL,15,Fspread east during the morning. The
OL,16,Fwind will strengthen from the morning,
OL,17,Freaching gale to severe gale later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
