OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStorm
OL,6,FBoelo will bring severe gales and
OL,7,Fheavy showers Sunday. Dry and bright
OL,8,Fmorning Monday, becoming windy with
OL,9,Frain later. Very windy with showers,
OL,10,Fsome heavy, Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
